      "statement": "Service configuration is declaratively defined in two setup files: ulabase.setup.ts (base configuration that imports environment.ts, derives the accounts feature flags from the app's flags, sets app name/frontend URLs, conditionally configures Google OAuth, allowlists the app origin, and exports a final appPointsAtService step that rewrites the apiUrl line) and ulabase.setup.consents.ts (imports those steps and adds the consents gate: a userConsentsSchema, a userCanPatchOwnConsents permission that stamps TOS_VERSION/PP_VERSION server-side, two latestConsents claims, and a consentsGate guards rule answering 451). Both are documented in the Service Setup page.",
